-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A NOTE ON CLINICAL USE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

CamKIT is a research prototype of a clinical decision-support aid, published
for research use only. It is not a registered medical device. The "AS IS" and
no-liability terms above are not boilerplate here: if you fork this, change the
scoring or the band thresholds, and deploy it, the output is your
responsibility and no longer represents the validated CamKIT tool. Please do
not present a modified version under the CamKIT name.
